//
// All four dictionaries live above, because this file is the source and every
// i18n suite asserts against it. At BUILD time tools/split-i18n.cjs lifts
// fr/es/el into js/i18n/<lang>.js and the loader fetches only the one in use -
// measured at 69,304 bytes gzipped, 20.6% of the bundle, carried by every
// athlete to hold three languages they are not reading.
//
